# SupremeOS native-linux — On-box AI assistant environment.
#
# Direct counterpart to infra/hub-compose/docker-compose.yml's `ai` service `environment:`
# block. SUPREME_AI_MODEL_PATH is empty by default in BOTH deployments — no GGUF model is
# ever shipped in the repo/image; the service's deterministic-planner fallback runs until a
# homeowner-provided model is placed at ___SUPREME_DATA_DIR___/ai-models and this file is
# hand-edited to point at it (matching Docker's own SUPREME_AI_MODEL_PATH opt-in).
#
# Rendered to /etc/supremeos/ai.env (mode 0640, owned root:supreme) by install.sh.

SUPREME_AI_MODEL_PATH=""
